cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DiffServ4NS for ns-2: the 2001 original and the 2026 ns-2.35 port"
message: >-
  If you use this software in academic work, please cite both the
  software (this entry, repository-code) and the peer-reviewed 2002 ISCC
  paper (preferred-citation below).  The 2001 thesis is the authoritative
  design document and is listed under references.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sergio
    family-names: Andreozzi
